# Runtime & Platform Governance

**Contracts:** `RUNTIME-CONTRACT.md`, `PLATFORM-CONTRACT.md`

## Active Runtimes

- `web-inertia` (React + Inertia) — primary UI
- `api-json` (REST + Sanctum) — API clients

## Do Not Introduce Without ADR

Electron, Tauri, Vue, Blazor Hybrid, standalone SPA — unless architectural requirement proven. Desktop Blazor target: `DESKTOP-UI-GOVERNANCE.md`.

## Platform Resolver (conceptual)

```text
capabilities → presentation profile → UI adapter → components
```

Resolver has **zero business logic**.

## Same Feature, Multiple Presentations

One logical contract (`StudentForm`, `EnrollmentCreate`) — desktop/tablet/mobile presentations differ; API/auth/validation/audit stay identical.

## Desktop Host

Electron/Tauri may host web UI only — never own business rules or authorization.
